1)  That there be an "animate object" spell/wand.  If cast on a statue, it 
would bring it to life; if cast on an object, it would follow you around
as if it were a pet.  Both of these would only last for a limited amount
of time.  Note that there's no guarentee that an animated object would be
friendly.

2)  That Nymph's not be able to seduce you while you're blind.  However, a 
new type of Nymph be created; the Siren.  (S)he'd be able to seduce you only
if you weren't deaf.  Thus causing suggestion 3...

3)  Earplugs.  You'd be immune to the siren, if there are any monsters who
have attacks based on sound, you wouldn't hear them.  Magic earplugs would
give you the equivilant of aural esp.  


